  "text": "## Estimated Timeline\n\nDeployment schedules depend on application architecture and infrastructure complexity:\n\n- **Standard Application Dockerization & VPS Setup**: 1 to 2 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n- **Multi-Container SaaS Cloud Deployment with CI/CD**: 2 to 4 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n- **Complex Enterprise Infrastructure & Migration**: 4 to 6 weeks from discovery to deployment.\n\n---",
